      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named `safety_threshold.py` that applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text. I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for this task. Amazon Comprehend is a suitable choice for text analysis and content safety. I will use the Amazon Comprehend SDK to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
