    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the redact_unsafe.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for text safety. I will use Amazon Comprehend, a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. The service can detect unsafe content, and I will use its API to flag or redact unsafe spans from text. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the use of the comprehend client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889306480,
          "start": 1789889303096
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdb75238001DTys71ZNMD4qw0",
      "message_id": "msg_0bdb74ddd0014mpcLVCeMFZrPc",
      "session_id": "ses_f4248b230ffe0h2UUEZPQ9Sd3u",
